{"4346720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHUFF IT", "steam_appid": 4346720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Arcade Trackball Support</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CABINET READY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building this game around as many of the common arcade trackball / control panel encoders as we can with the goal of making this a seamless plug-and-play experience. Feel free to reach out on Discord to provide me with your current encoder and I will do my best to make sure it's ready to go at launch!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURRENT ENCODER COMPATIBILITY </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any encoder that translates trackball movement to mouse / keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opti-Wiz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JPAC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native encoders that pass-through raw trackball signals to Windows</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC ARCADE FEEL. MODERN EDGE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHUFF IT</strong> brings shuffleboard back to its roots—trackball in hand, cabinet-ready, no excuses. It’s fast, physical, and unforgiving. Whether you’re finessing a perfect curl around a blocker or blasting your opponent’s puck off the edge, this is pure arcade intensity reimagined for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by a custom physics engine, <strong>SHUFF IT</strong> was built from the ground up for <strong>true trackball control</strong>. Every flick, curve, and smash is tuned to feel right. If the puck doesn’t move like it should, what’s the point?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR THE TRACKBALL. DIALED FOR FEEL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casual chaos to calculated shots, <strong>SHUFF IT</strong> rewards precision, timing, and guts. Nail the hammer. Ride the rail. Drop it in the zone or get out of the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODES AVAILABLE AT LAUNCH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P vs. 2P</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P vs. CPU (4 levels of difficulty, each with own play style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P PINPOINT Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P CHAOS Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY MODIFIERS AVAILABLE AT LAUNCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Basic Table (1/2/3 Scoring)</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Round Classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over The Edge (First to 3 Hangers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cornhole Rules (Like at the Cabin)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>&quot;Deck&quot; Rules (Floor Scoring)</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Round Deck Rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to 68</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC ARCADE FEEL. MODERN EDGE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHUFF IT</strong> brings shuffleboard back to its roots—trackball in hand, cabinet-ready, no excuses. It’s fast, physical, and unforgiving. Whether you’re finessing a perfect curl around a blocker or blasting your opponent’s puck off the edge, this is pure arcade intensity reimagined for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by a custom physics engine, <strong>SHUFF IT</strong> was built from the ground up for <strong>true trackball control</strong>. Every flick, curve, and smash is tuned to feel right. If the puck doesn’t move like it should, what’s the point?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR THE TRACKBALL. DIALED FOR FEEL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casual chaos to calculated shots, <strong>SHUFF IT</strong> rewards precision, timing, and guts. Nail the hammer. Ride the rail. Drop it in the zone or get out of the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODES AVAILABLE AT LAUNCH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P vs. 2P</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P vs. CPU (4 levels of difficulty, each with own play style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P PINPOINT Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1P CHAOS Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16P Tournament Bracket (can auto-fill with non-human CPU players)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY MODIFIERS AVAILABLE AT LAUNCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Basic Table (1/2/3 Scoring)</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Round Classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over The Edge (First to 3 Hangers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cornhole Rules (Like at the Cabin)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>&quot;Deck&quot; Rules (Floor Scoring)</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Round Deck Rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to 68</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "REAL TRACKBALL. VIRTUAL SHUFFLEBOARD. No gimmicks. No fluff. Just pure cabinet-ready action, remastered for the modern gamer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346720/eb7bb3eb5df05187481